  "reasoning": "The defendants, acting as company executives, fabricated the existence of a fully funded tourism project and used false documents to induce multiple construction companies to sign contracts and pay deposits, guarantee money, and fees. Their conduct involved deceit to obtain money from the victims, fitting the legal definition of contract fraud (合同诈骗). No other distinct crimes such as theft, robbery, or illegal possession are described. Therefore the appropriate charge is contract fraud.",
